<title>USA: Unifi denies rumor of upcoming debt issue.</title>
<headline>Unifi denies rumor of upcoming debt issue.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unifi Inc denied rumors it would be issuing a $200 million corporate debt offering later this week, a company spokesman said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Unifi Inc is not planning to issue a debt offering,&quot; the spokesman said.</p>
<p>Earlier, syndicate sources reported rumors of a seven-year 144A debt offering via underwriter Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675</p>
</text>
